<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian Sept unemployment unch at 4.1 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Austrian Sept unemployment unch at 4.1 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Social Affairs Ministry reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	  Sept	August	Sept 95</p>
<p> Percentage of workforce	4.1	 4.1	    4.6</p>
<p> Total			   191,867     189,899	181,572</p>
<p>NOTE - The September and August 1996 figures were calculated by the European Statistics Office, and are based on a 1995 census. The August 1995 figure was calculated by the Austrian Social Affairs Ministry based on a 1994 census and is not directly comparable.</p>
<p>Since December 1995, Austria has calculated percentage of workforce according to EU standards and all previous figures were calculated according to OECD standards.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
</text>
